# Schema: Pezkuwi SDK PRDoc Schema (prdoc) v1.0.0
# See doc at https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pezkuwichain/pezkuwi-sdk/master/prdoc/schema_user.json

title: Improve pallet-tiki EnsureOrigin documentation for CI exclusion

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Adds comprehensive documentation to pallet-tiki's EnsureOrigin implementation
      explaining why the pallet must be excluded from `cargo check --benches` due to
      Cargo feature unification behavior with the `try_successful_origin` method.

      Documents the CI workflow exclusion in `.github/workflows/tests-misc.yml` and
      clarifies that the `#[cfg(feature = "runtime-benchmarks")]` attribute must
      remain on the method implementation.

crates:
  - name: pallet-tiki
    bump: patch
